# Add project specific R8 rules here.
# AGP will combine all keep rule files in src/main/keepRules to pass to R8
#
# For more details, see
#   https://d.android.com/r/tools/r8/keep-rules
#
# NOTE — this project's rules do NOT live here. They are in app/proguard-rules.pro,
# named explicitly by `proguardFiles(...)` in the release build type, which is also
# where the reasoning for each one is written down. Both files are genuinely applied
# (each shows up as its own section in
# app/build/outputs/mapping/release/configuration.txt), so a rule added here would
# work — it would just be somewhere nobody is looking. Keep them in one place.

# If your project uses WebView with JS, uncomment the following
# and specify the fully qualified class name to the JavaScript interface
# class:
#-keepclassmembers class fqcn.of.javascript.interface.for.webview {
#   public *;
#}